  `leatherDef`/`specificMeatDef` repoint to the already-ported
  RSW_Leather_Insectile/RSW_Insectile_Meat (RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml,
  Pass 3, CanCell — same donor Leather_Insectile/Insectile_Meat this species
