  Textures/swanimals/Gutkurr/.

  No `*ArtOverride` mod exists for this species (checked the full ~26-mod
  override-folder listing, not a remembered short list).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: `Desert` only (0.4) — the donor's
  own `wildBiomes` lists several biomes at nonzero weight (kept verbatim
  below, unmodified, as every prior pass does), but `cast_assignment.csv`'s
  own ground truth ("dumps and harvests decay" doctrine, per the Fanback
  staleness lesson) has exactly one live row for this species, `Desert`
  0.4, status `adjust-keep`. Repointed from the bare "Gutkurr" entry in
  cast_assignment.csv / both BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml copies.

  ⚠️ **Known gap, flagged not fixed, matching the Wave A wiring-gap
  precedent (2026-09-09)**: `cast_assignment.csv`'s own reason field notes
  "owner card 2026-09-09: slowed 4.5→4.4" — this tuning is applied by a
  SEPARATE generated file, `BiomeFaunaStatAdjustments_Generated.xml`
